WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:08.875
&gt;&gt; MARTHA: WE HAVE FOCUSED A LOT

00:00:08.876 --> 00:00:09.490
&gt;&gt; MARTHA: WE HAVE FOCUSED A LOT

00:00:09.491 --> 00:00:11.097
ON THE STORY ON ONE OF THE MOST

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.037
IMPORTANT AND LARGEST PARTS OF

00:00:13.038 --> 00:00:14.357
THE TRAGIC CORONAVIRUS DEATHS

00:00:14.391 --> 00:00:15.823
THAT HAVE HAPPENED IN AMERICA.

00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:18.927
YES, WE KNOW THAT THE VIRUS

00:00:18.928 --> 00:00:20.402
ATTACKS THE OLD PRIMARILY, BUT

00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:23.029
THE LEVEL OF ACCEPTANCE AND IN

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:25.289
SOMEWHERE CASES, WHAT APPEARS TO

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.025
HAVE BEEN OUTRIGHT NEGLIGENCE

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.995
THAT LED TO SOME OF THESE

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.830
DEATHS, CERTAINLY CRIES OUT FOR

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:31.902
SOME INQUIRY AND SOME

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:32.209
INVESTIGATION.

00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:34.694
SO IT’S EASY TO SEE THAT

00:00:34.695 --> 00:00:36.033
SOMETHING IS JUST NOT RIGHT AND

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:38.565
SOME OF THESE SITUATIONS AND WE

00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:40.126
OWE THESE PEOPLE, THE VETERANS

00:00:40.128 --> 00:00:41.871
AMONG THEM AND THEIR FAMILIES,

00:00:41.872 --> 00:00:43.029
SOME ANSWERS THAT ARE BETTER

00:00:43.063 --> 00:00:44.573
PERHAPS THAN THIS ONE THAT WE

00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:45.607
ARE TODAY FROM THE GOVERNOR OF

00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:46.710
NEW YORK.

00:00:46.711 --> 00:00:48.785
HE WAS ASKED ABOUT THE 139

00:00:48.786 --> 00:00:50.451
NEW YORKERS IN LONG-TERM CARE

00:00:50.453 --> 00:00:51.850
WHO DIED, AND I WAS JUST ON

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:53.074
SATURDAY.

00:00:53.108 --> 00:00:55.032
HERE’S WHAT HE SAID.

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:57.472
&gt;&gt; FAMILIES WHO SUFFERED LOSSES

00:00:57.506 --> 00:00:58.973
INSIDE NURSING HOMES AND THEY’RE

00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:00.504
LOOKING FOR ACCOUNTABILITY AND

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:02.225
THEY’D LIKE TO SEE JUSTICE.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:04.145
&gt;&gt; HOW DO WE GET JUSTICE FOR

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:06.848
THOSE FAMILIES WHO HAD 139

00:01:06.849 --> 00:01:09.596
DEATHS HE MET WHAT IS JUSTICE?

00:01:09.598 --> 00:01:12.775
WHO CAN WE PROSECUTE FOR THOSE

00:01:12.776 --> 00:01:13.174
DEATHS?

00:01:13.175 --> 00:01:13.997
NOBODY.

00:01:13.998 --> 00:01:16.367
OLDER PEOPLE, VULNERABLE PEOPLE,

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:19.218
ARE GOING TO DIE FROM THIS

00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:23.255
VIRUS, AND THAT IS A FACT, AND

00:01:23.256 --> 00:01:27.756
THAT IS NOT GOING TO CHANGE.

00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:29.131
&gt;&gt; MARTHA: ABOUT 5600

00:01:29.132 --> 00:01:32.095
NEW YORKERS DIED IN NURSING

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.533
HOMES OF COVID-19 AND NEW

00:01:34.535 --> 00:01:38.267
NATIONWIDE DATA SAYS THAT 41% OF

00:01:38.302 --> 00:01:41.302
ALL THE DEATHS IN AMERICA FROM

00:01:41.303 --> 00:01:45.348
THIS VIRUS ARE TRACED TO NURSING

00:01:45.382 --> 00:01:46.836
HOMES OR ASSISTED LIVING

00:01:46.837 --> 00:01:47.626
FACILITIES, 41%.

00:01:47.627 --> 00:01:49.221
JOINING ME NOW AS A PERSON IN

00:01:49.256 --> 00:01:50.808
CHARGE OF OVERSEEING THESE

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.288
FACILITIES AT THE FEDERAL LEVEL,

00:01:52.289 --> 00:01:54.095
ADMINISTRATOR FOR THE CENTERS

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.339
FOR MEDICARE AND MEDICAID

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:57.237
SERVICES, ALSO A MEMBER OF

00:01:57.271 --> 00:01:58.414
COURSE OF THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:58.415 --> 00:02:00.164
TASK FORCE ON THE VIRUS.

00:02:00.165 --> 00:02:01.862
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR BEING HERE

00:02:01.863 --> 00:02:03.365
TONIGHT, GOOD TO HAVE YOU WITH

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:03.580
US.

00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:06.291
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THANKS FOR HAVING ME,

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.072
GOOD TO SEE YOU.

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:10.009
&gt;&gt; MARTHA: SO GOOD TO SEE YOU.

00:02:10.043 --> 00:02:10.821
WHAT’S YOUR REACTION?

00:02:10.822 --> 00:02:12.759
YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU HEAR THAT

00:02:12.794 --> 00:02:15.237
FROM GOVERNOR CUOMO, AND I’VE

00:02:15.239 --> 00:02:17.827
SPOKEN TO FAMILIES WHO HAVE LOST

00:02:17.828 --> 00:02:19.640
LOVED ONES IN THIS SITUATION.

00:02:19.641 --> 00:02:21.241
THAT IS NOT A STATEMENT FROM HIM

00:02:21.243 --> 00:02:24.862
THAT IS GOING TO GIVE MANY OF

00:02:24.863 --> 00:02:26.687
THEM A WHOLE LOT OF COMFORT.

00:02:26.689 --> 00:02:27.973
&gt;&gt; MARTHA, EVERY LIFE IS

00:02:27.974 --> 00:02:30.162
PRECIOUS, AND THAT’S WHAT THIS

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:31.057
ADMINISTRATION STARTED VERY

00:02:31.059 --> 00:02:32.388
EARLY IN MAKING SURE THAT WE

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:34.814
WERE DOING EVERYTHING WE CAN TO

00:02:34.816 --> 00:02:36.093
KEEP NURSING HOME RESIDENTS

00:02:36.127 --> 00:02:36.866
SAFE.

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:37.996
THEY DESERVE THAT.

00:02:37.997 --> 00:02:39.614
OLDER INDIVIDUALS HAVE BEEN

00:02:39.616 --> 00:02:41.224
TAKING CARE OF US THEIR WHOLE

00:02:41.226 --> 00:02:44.572
LIVES AND THEY DESERVE TO BE

00:02:44.573 --> 00:02:46.629
RESPECTED AND TO BE PROTECTED.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.255
&gt;&gt; MARTHA: SO I GUESS WHEN YOU

00:02:48.257 --> 00:02:50.558
SAY YOU’VE BEEN DOING EVERYTHING

00:02:50.559 --> 00:02:53.605
THAT YOU CAN, I’M CURIOUS WHAT

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.458
THAT EXACTLY MEANS.

00:02:55.493 --> 00:02:58.282
SO WHAT HAVE YOU, FROM THE

00:02:58.284 --> 00:02:59.682
FEDERAL PERSPECTIVE, MANDATED.

00:02:59.683 --> 00:03:01.015
DID YOU MANDATE TESTING RIGHT

00:03:01.017 --> 00:03:01.497
AWAY?

00:03:01.499 --> 00:03:03.510
DID YOU SEARCH TESTS TO ALL OF

00:03:03.511 --> 00:03:05.269
THE FACILITIES AROUND THE

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:07.609
COUNTRY RIGHT AWAY TO THAT’S ONE

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:08.862
QUESTION THAT I HAVE.

00:03:08.863 --> 00:03:11.517
WHAT DID YOU MANDATE IN TERMS OF

00:03:11.552 --> 00:03:13.040
TESTING, AND WHEN?

00:03:13.074 --> 00:03:14.666
&gt;&gt; SO STARTING FROM A BROAD

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:15.953
OVERSIGHT, FROM THE VERY

00:03:15.955 --> 00:03:16.760
BEGINNING WE RECOGNIZE THAT

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:19.174
NURSING HOMES THAT WERE GOING TO

00:03:19.209 --> 00:03:20.726
BE VULNERABLE AND WE PUT OUT A

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.111
SERIES OF GUIDANCE AND

00:03:22.146 --> 00:03:23.202
RECOMMENDATIONS TO OUR NURSING

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:23.594
HOMES.

00:03:23.596 --> 00:03:27.535
WE ALSO HAVE BEEN WORKING WITH

00:03:27.537 --> 00:03:30.165
STATE AND LOCAL OFFICIALS, JUST

00:03:30.166 --> 00:03:31.433
TO LEVEL SET THE RESPONSIBILITY

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:32.671
OF OVERSIGHT OF BOTH THE FEDERAL

00:03:32.706 --> 00:03:33.849
AND STATE GOVERNMENT.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.496
ON THE FEDERAL LEVEL WE SET THE

00:03:35.497 --> 00:03:36.889
GUIDELINES IN THE STATES ARE

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:38.096
ACTUALLY BOOTS ON THE GROUND,

00:03:38.097 --> 00:03:40.911
THEY DO THE INSPECTIONS AND ARE

00:03:40.945 --> 00:03:41.567
RESPONSIBLE FOR LICENSING.

00:03:41.569 --> 00:03:42.572
AND ONE OF THE THINGS --

00:03:42.606 --> 00:03:43.358
=SPEEONE SO YOU ONLY DO -- LET
ME

00:03:44.327 --> 00:03:45.827
JUST CLARIFY THAT, YOU WOULD SAY

00:03:45.862 --> 00:03:47.205
JUST CLARIFY THAT, YOU WOULD SAY

00:03:47.239 --> 00:03:50.452
THAT YOU DO NOT HAVE ANY ABILITY

00:03:50.453 --> 00:03:51.629
TO MANDATE ANYTHING THAT HAPPENS

00:03:51.663 --> 00:03:53.634
AT THESE FACILITIES, IS THAT

00:03:53.635 --> 00:03:55.145
WHAT YOU’RE SAYING?

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.415
YOU CANNOT MANDATE ANYTHING AT

00:03:57.417 --> 00:03:57.656
THEM?

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.091
&gt;&gt; THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT SETS

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:01.324
REQUIREMENTS, AND SO IF A

00:04:01.325 --> 00:04:04.069
NURSING HOME IS IN VIOLATION OF

00:04:04.071 --> 00:04:05.840
ANY OF THOSE REQUIREMENTS, THE

00:04:05.841 --> 00:04:06.683
SAVAGELY SANCTIONS OR MONETARY

00:04:06.684 --> 00:04:09.603
PENALTIES AND WE ALSO HAVE THE

00:04:09.604 --> 00:04:11.782
ABILITY TO REVOKE MEDICARE AND

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:12.831
MEDICAID PAYMENTS, BUT THE

00:04:12.832 --> 00:04:14.755
LICENSING OF THESE FACILITIES

00:04:14.756 --> 00:04:17.975
AND THEIR ABILITY TO OPERATE

00:04:17.976 --> 00:04:20.369
RESTS WITH THE STATES, SO IT’S A

00:04:20.404 --> 00:04:21.643
JOINT FEDERAL STATE PARTNERSHIP.

00:04:21.677 --> 00:04:22.859
&gt;&gt; Martha: SO ONE OF THE

00:04:22.893 --> 00:04:24.114
THINGS EFFORT FROM, PEOPLE THAT

00:04:24.115 --> 00:04:25.506
I’VE SPOKEN TO IN NURSING HOMES,

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.082
IS THAT IN THE BEGINNING THEY

00:04:27.116 --> 00:04:28.118
COULDN’T GET THE TESTS THAT THEY

00:04:28.153 --> 00:04:29.832
WANTED, THEN THAT THEY GOT THE

00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:31.691
TEST THAT THEY WANTED, IT WOULD

00:04:31.692 --> 00:04:34.014
TAKE AT LEAST A WEEK TO TURN

00:04:34.015 --> 00:04:35.059
AROUND, SO THEY WOULD HAVE

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.606
PATIENTS TOGETHER IN THESE

00:04:36.607 --> 00:04:37.772
SOMETIMES CLOSE QUARTERS WHERE,

00:04:37.773 --> 00:04:39.990
YOU KNOW, THEY’RE WAITING A WEEK

00:04:39.991 --> 00:04:41.573
AND AT THAT POINT IT’S TOO LATE

00:04:41.574 --> 00:04:42.993
IN THE DISEASE, THE VIRUS HAS

00:04:42.995 --> 00:04:45.123
BEGUN TO SPREAD, YOU KNOW,

00:04:45.157 --> 00:04:46.373
THROUGHOUT THAT ENTIRE HALLWAY,

00:04:46.407 --> 00:04:49.179
SO WHY IS IT -- HAVING SEEN WHAT

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.638
WE SAW IN ITALY, WE KNEW THAT

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.076
THE FIRST HOT SPOT WAS

00:04:52.077 --> 00:04:53.364
WASHINGTON STATE IN THAT HOME

00:04:53.398 --> 00:04:53.689
THERE.

00:04:53.723 --> 00:04:55.640
WHY WASN’T IT THAT THE BEST

00:04:55.641 --> 00:04:58.361
TESTS THAT WE HAD WERE NOT

00:04:58.362 --> 00:04:59.800
SURGED TO THESE FACILITIES,

00:04:59.834 --> 00:05:02.003
WHICH WE KNEW HOUSED THE MOST

00:05:02.038 --> 00:05:03.528
VULNERABLE POPULATION IN THE

00:05:03.529 --> 00:05:04.317
WHOLE COUNTRY RIGHT AWAY?

00:05:04.318 --> 00:05:07.155
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE THINGS THAT WE

00:05:07.157 --> 00:05:08.875
CALLED ON WEEKS AGO IS A CALL TO

00:05:08.876 --> 00:05:11.004
ACTION FOR STATE AND LOCAL

00:05:11.005 --> 00:05:12.484
LEADERS TO EMPHASIZE AND TO WORK

00:05:12.519 --> 00:05:14.651
WITH NURSING FACILITIES TO MAKE

00:05:14.686 --> 00:05:16.285
SURE THAT THEY HAD ACCESS TO

00:05:16.287 --> 00:05:16.565
TESTING.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.539
ONE OF THE THINGS WE DID ON THE

00:05:18.573 --> 00:05:19.461
FEDERAL LEVEL WAS TO INCREASE

00:05:19.495 --> 00:05:21.042
MEMBERS AND FOR TESTING AND

00:05:21.077 --> 00:05:23.318
ACTUALLY FOR THE FIRST TIME PAY

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.725
FOR LABS TO GO OUT TO NURSING

00:05:24.726 --> 00:05:27.573
HOMES TO COLLECT SAMPLES SO ON

00:05:27.575 --> 00:05:29.635
THE FEDERAL LEVEL WITH MADE THAT

00:05:29.669 --> 00:05:30.454
RECOMMENDATION, WE CALLED TO

00:05:30.489 --> 00:05:32.114
ACTION AND YOU’VE SEEN A

00:05:32.115 --> 00:05:32.820
RESPONSE TO THAT.

00:05:32.854 --> 00:05:35.214
WE’VE SEEN GOVERNORS ACROSS THE

00:05:35.249 --> 00:05:36.366
COUNTRY TESTING THE NURSING

00:05:36.367 --> 00:05:36.792
HOMES.

00:05:36.826 --> 00:05:38.113
YOU’VE SEEN THAT INCREASE IN

00:05:38.114 --> 00:05:39.160
REIMBURSEMENT AND BECAUSE OF

00:05:39.194 --> 00:05:42.007
THAT WE ARE SEEING MORE AND MORE

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.956
NURSING HOMES BEING TESTED, BUT

00:05:43.991 --> 00:05:45.262
TODAY, WE ISSUED GUIDELINES FOR

00:05:45.296 --> 00:05:47.388
STATE AND LOCAL OFFICIALS AND

00:05:47.423 --> 00:05:48.511
NURSING HOMES ABOUT REOPENING --

00:05:48.546 --> 00:05:50.171
&gt;&gt; Martha: PART OF THAT SOUNDS

00:05:50.173 --> 00:05:51.714
LIKE IT DECIDED TO STOP SHORT OF

00:05:51.715 --> 00:05:52.574
MANDATING ANY OF IT.

00:05:52.609 --> 00:05:53.658
I’M LOOKING AT A QUOTE FROM THE

00:05:53.693 --> 00:05:56.187
PRESIDENT, HE WAS ASKED IF YOU

00:05:56.188 --> 00:05:57.471
WANT TO CONSIDER A NATIONWIDE

00:05:57.505 --> 00:05:59.176
MANDATE FOR TESTING AND HE SAID

00:05:59.211 --> 00:06:00.274
I WOULD MANDATE IT IF YOU’D

00:06:00.275 --> 00:06:00.647
LIKE.

00:06:00.681 --> 00:06:02.059
I THINK IT’S AN IMPORTANT THING

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.076
TO DO AND WE KNOW THAT

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.458
VICE PRESIDENT PENCE HAS TALKED

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.532
ABOUT IT TOO BUT AFTER THIS

00:06:05.533 --> 00:06:06.608
POINT CAN YOU JUST CLARIFY FOR

00:06:06.642 --> 00:06:09.074
ME THAT THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT

00:06:09.108 --> 00:06:11.131
HAS NOT MANDATED THAT THESE

00:06:11.133 --> 00:06:12.435
FACILITIES HAVE PROVIDED THEM

00:06:12.436 --> 00:06:15.243
WITH THE ABILITY TO DO SO, IS

00:06:15.244 --> 00:06:16.476
THAT A CORRECT STATEMENT?

00:06:16.477 --> 00:06:17.457
&gt;&gt; WE PUT THESE RECOMMENDATIONS

00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:19.166
AND GUIDELINES FOR STATES AND

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:20.815
FOR THE NURSING HOMES.

00:06:20.816 --> 00:06:22.285
WE TALKED TO THE NURSING HOME

00:06:22.319 --> 00:06:23.834
ASSOCIATION, THEIR SUPPORTIVE OF

00:06:23.868 --> 00:06:24.410
THESE EFFORTS.

00:06:24.412 --> 00:06:25.351
GOVERNORS ARE SUPPORTIVE OF

00:06:25.352 --> 00:06:27.426
THESE EFFORTS BUT IF WE FELT

00:06:27.428 --> 00:06:28.926
LIKE THERE WASN’T COMPLIANCE AND

00:06:28.961 --> 00:06:30.761
WE COULD MOVE TOWARDS A

00:06:30.795 --> 00:06:32.445
REQUIREMENT, BUT AT THIS TIME WE

00:06:32.447 --> 00:06:33.389
FEEL LIKE THE RECOMMENDATION

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.965
AROUND TESTING AS A BASELINE, SO

00:06:35.966 --> 00:06:38.558
WE NOT ONLY WANT TO TEST THE

00:06:38.559 --> 00:06:40.100
RESIDENTS, BUT WE ALSO WANT TO

00:06:40.101 --> 00:06:41.294
MAKE SURE THAT THE HEALTH CARE

00:06:41.328 --> 00:06:42.551
STAFF AND THAT NURSING FACILITY

00:06:42.553 --> 00:06:44.219
IS ALSO TESTED AS WELL, AND

00:06:44.253 --> 00:06:45.128
THAT’S GOING TO --

00:06:45.129 --> 00:06:46.094
&gt;&gt; Martha: EVERYBODY WANTS TO

00:06:46.095 --> 00:06:47.572
MAKE SURE THAT THAT’S WHAT’S

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.188
HAPPENING, BUT FROM WHAT I’M

00:06:49.223 --> 00:06:50.917
LEARNING LOOKING INTO THIS, IT’S

00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:52.239
SPOTTY, SOME PLACES DON’T HAVE

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.475
THE TESTING THEY NEED, SOME

00:06:53.477 --> 00:06:54.637
PLACES DON’T HAVE THE TESTS THAT

00:06:54.638 --> 00:06:56.626
THEY NEED, WITH REGARD TO THE

00:06:56.628 --> 00:06:59.225
OTHER QUESTION THAT I HAVE, IN

00:06:59.226 --> 00:07:00.880
THE INITIAL SURGE OF THIS, WHEN

00:07:00.915 --> 00:07:02.842
WE KNEW THESE WERE THE MOST

00:07:02.877 --> 00:07:04.084
VULNERABLE PLACES IN THE WHOLE

00:07:04.118 --> 00:07:05.937
COUNTRY AND THEN WE BUILT THESE

00:07:05.971 --> 00:07:07.504
FEMA FACILITIES WITH A LOT OF

00:07:07.505 --> 00:07:09.780
EXTRA BEDS AND THEN IT WAS, YOU

00:07:09.814 --> 00:07:11.639
KNOW, SORT OF GOOD NEWS THAT ALL

00:07:11.674 --> 00:07:13.949
OF THE BEDS WERE NEEDED, AND WE

00:07:13.983 --> 00:07:15.241
HAVE PICTURES OF ALL OF THESE,

00:07:15.276 --> 00:07:17.085
THESE INCREDIBLE FACILITIES THAT

00:07:17.086 --> 00:07:20.047
WE HEARD ABOUT AND THEN, YOU

00:07:20.081 --> 00:07:22.492
KNOW, APRIL 30TH, YOU HAVE THE

00:07:22.526 --> 00:07:26.476
COMFORT IN NEW YORK CITY, WHICH

00:07:26.477 --> 00:07:28.684
WAS CONVERTED TO BE A COVID

00:07:28.685 --> 00:07:29.896
FACILITY, SAILING AWAY FROM

00:07:29.898 --> 00:07:31.244
NEW YORK AT THAT POINT.

00:07:31.245 --> 00:07:33.120
WHY WAS -- AND IF THE ANSWER IS

00:07:33.122 --> 00:07:35.002
THAT THIS IS NOT A FEDERAL

00:07:35.037 --> 00:07:36.926
QUESTION, IT REALLY FALLS TO THE

00:07:36.961 --> 00:07:39.025
GOVERNOR, AND I’VE ASKED, YOU

00:07:39.026 --> 00:07:40.617
KNOW, NEW YORK OFFICIALS THIS AS

00:07:40.651 --> 00:07:42.678
WELL, BUT WHAT TO SAY TO WHY

00:07:42.679 --> 00:07:43.835
THOSE INDIVIDUALS WEREN’T TAKING

00:07:43.869 --> 00:07:44.998
OUT OF THE NURSING HOMES WHERE

00:07:44.999 --> 00:07:45.785
THEY WERE INFECTING PEOPLE ALL

00:07:45.787 --> 00:07:47.365
UP AND DOWN THE CORRIDOR AND PUT

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.134
IN THESE PLACES THAT WERE SUCH A

00:07:49.169 --> 00:07:50.696
WONDERFUL FACILITY THAT WAS

00:07:50.697 --> 00:07:52.429
BUILT BY THE ARMY CORPS OF

00:07:52.463 --> 00:07:52.688
ENGINEERS?

00:07:52.689 --> 00:07:54.174
&gt;&gt; THAT’S RIGHT.

00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:55.778
AND MARTHA, IT’S VERY CLEAR,

00:07:55.813 --> 00:07:56.958
FEDERAL GUIDELINES MAKE IT VERY

00:07:56.992 --> 00:07:58.575
CLEAR THAT WHEN YOU ARE

00:07:58.609 --> 00:08:00.204
DISCHARGING A PATIENT FROM THE

00:08:00.238 --> 00:08:01.255
HOSPITAL, IS THE OBLIGATION TO

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.329
MAKE SURE THAT THAT PATIENT IS

00:08:03.364 --> 00:08:04.693
BEING DISCHARGED, WHETHER IT’S

00:08:04.694 --> 00:08:06.656
GOING HOME OR GOING BACK TO THE

00:08:06.658 --> 00:08:07.679
NURSING HOME, THAT THE NURSING

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.667
HOME HAS THE CAPACITY TO DEAL

00:08:09.668 --> 00:08:10.819
WITH THOSE PATIENTS, AND SO IF

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:11.937
THE NURSING HOME IS SAYING WE

00:08:11.938 --> 00:08:13.816
ARE NOT ABLE TO ACCEPT THAT

00:08:13.817 --> 00:08:15.650
PATIENT, THE METS SOMETHING THAT

00:08:15.651 --> 00:08:17.485
HAS TO BE TAKEN INTO

00:08:17.486 --> 00:08:17.909
CONSIDERATION.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.213
WHEN DOCTORS AND HOSPITALS ARE

00:08:19.214 --> 00:08:19.808
DISCHARGING PATIENTS FROM

00:08:19.809 --> 00:08:22.099
HOSPITALS, THEY HAVE TO MAKE

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.428
SURE THAT WE ARE DISCHARGING THE

00:08:23.462 --> 00:08:25.486
PATIENT TO A PLACE THAT CAN

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.305
ACCOMMODATE THEIR NEEDS AND IF

00:08:28.339 --> 00:08:29.902
THAT PERSON IS STILL FORTUNATELY

00:08:29.936 --> 00:08:30.564
FORTUNATELY -- UNFORTUNATELY

00:08:30.598 --> 00:08:31.367
TESTING POSITIVE, THEY NEED TO

00:08:31.402 --> 00:08:33.546
BE ISOLATED AND WAYS TO MAKE

00:08:33.547 --> 00:08:35.693
SURE THAT ISOLATION AND CARE CAN

00:08:35.694 --> 00:08:37.170
CONTINUE IN THE MOST APPROPRIATE

00:08:37.204 --> 00:08:37.483
SETTING.

00:08:37.485 --> 00:08:38.898
&gt;&gt; Martha: WELL, WE KNOW THAT

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.551
IN NEW YORK AND NEW JERSEY, THE

00:08:40.585 --> 00:08:43.309
EPICENTER OF THE VIRUS, BOTH OF

00:08:43.344 --> 00:08:44.942
THOSE GOVERNORS INSISTED THAT

00:08:44.977 --> 00:08:46.229
THOSE PATIENTS, WHEN THEY WERE

00:08:46.231 --> 00:08:47.191
RELEASED FROM HOSPITALS, WENT

00:08:47.192 --> 00:08:49.461
BACK INTO THE NURSING HOME AND I

00:08:49.463 --> 00:08:50.755
HAVEN’T BEEN ABLE TO GET AN

00:08:50.757 --> 00:08:52.166
ANSWER TO WHY THEY WEREN’T SENT

00:08:52.168 --> 00:08:53.164
TO THESE OTHER FACILITIES,

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:56.083
BECAUSE WE KNOW THAT ONCE THEY

00:08:56.084 --> 00:08:57.843
WENT BACK TO THESE PLACES, THEY

00:08:57.877 --> 00:08:58.779
INFECTED OTHER PEOPLE, SOME OF

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.269
WHOM ENDED UP DYING AS A RESULT

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.418
OF THAT, SO IT’S TRAGIC AND IT

00:09:04.419 --> 00:09:06.358
IS, IN MY MIND, ONE OF THE MOST

00:09:06.392 --> 00:09:08.078
IMPORTANT QUESTIONS TO BE

00:09:08.079 --> 00:09:09.355
ANSWERED IN THIS WHOLE THING.

00:09:09.389 --> 00:09:11.615
40% OF THE PEOPLE WE’VE LOST

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.424
HAVE BEEN IN NURSING HOMES.

